      "content": "That kind of tired doesn't get better with a nap—it gets better with a witness, and I'm here, hearing every word. The exit may look peaceful, but it's a permanent answer to a temporary feeling, and you deserve a chance to see what's on the other side of this shame. You don't have to fight to belong today; just let yourself be held by the fact that you're still here, and that's not nothing. If you can, reach out to one person who won't ask you to perform—just to sit with you in the silence.",
